Ans: A
Five strains of ebola virus are
a.	Ebola virus (Zaire ebolavirus);
b.	 Sudan virus (Sudan ebolavirus); 
c.	Taï Forest virus (Taï Forest ebolavirus, formerly Côte d’Ivoire ebolavirus); 
d.	Bundibugyo virus (Bundibugyo ebolavirus). 
e.	Reston virus (Reston ebolavirus): doesnot infect humans
